<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan palladium imports surge 224 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan palladium imports surge 224 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in January surged 224 percent from a year earlier to 8.156 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.  </p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		    Jan 97     Dec 96	 Jan 96</p>
<p> Total	    8,156	5,096	   2,517</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   5,418	 2,742	  0,378</p>
<p> South Africa   1,474	 1,121	  0,803</p>
<p>Imports in 1996 were 77.41 tonnes, down 21.7 percent from 98.84 tonnes a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
